flowchart LR
    subgraph Offline[离线建库]
        Corpus[中英文语料 / 网页 XML] --> Builder[offline_builder]
        Builder --> Dict[词典 + 字符索引]
        Builder --> Pages[pages.dat + offsets.dat]
        Builder --> BM25[BM25 倒排索引 + 文档统计]
    end

    subgraph Online[在线服务]
        Browser[浏览器] --> HTTP[WebHttpServer]
        Client[TLV 客户端] --> TLV[SearchServer]
        HTTP --> Service[CachedSearchService]
        TLV --> Service
        Service --> Recommender[KeywordRecommender]
        Service --> Searcher[WebSearcher]
    end

    subgraph Cache[缓存层]
        Service --> L1[L1 Sharded W-TinyLFU]
        L1 --> L2[Redis L2 连接池]
        Service --> Flight[singleflight]
    end

    Dict --> Recommender
    BM25 --> Searcher
    Pages --> Searcher

